@startuml sequence_confirm_reservation
title Sequence — Confirm reservation (UC8)

actor Admin
participant API
participant DB
participant NotificationService
actor Customer

Admin -> API: POST /reservations/{id}/confirm
API -> DB: Load reservation
DB --> API: reservation

alt reservation is not DRAFT
  API --> Admin: 409 Conflict (cannot be confirmed)
else reservation is DRAFT
  API -> DB: Re-check availability (query CONFIRMED reservations)
  DB --> API: available / conflict

  alt available
    API -> DB: Update reservation state -> CONFIRMED
    API -> NotificationService: send_confirmation(reservation, user)
    NotificationService --> Customer: confirmation (log, or e-mail if SMTP is configured)
    API --> Admin: 200 OK (reservation CONFIRMED)
  else conflict
    API --> Admin: 409 Conflict (slot taken)
  end
end

note over API,DB
  Re-check ensures last-minute conflicts are detected.
end note

@enduml
